    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but it honestly feels like there's no point. even if i talk, nothing changes. i'm still just a drain on them. it's like eventually, their life would just be lighter if they didn't have to worry about me constantly. if i wasn't even in the picture, they could finally breathe again.",
