      "content": "it's not an illusion though. i see it in their eyes. they're just performing, being kind because they love me, but i can tell they're barely holding on because of me. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... stop being the problem? like, if i just wasn't here, they wouldn't have to struggle with me anymore. wouldn't that actually be the kindest thing i could do for them?",
